    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::632473778",
      "Source": "This specially blended pet food is a favorite of Daemonis. Containing only the finest natural ingredients, it provides Daemonis with the balanced nutrition they need. And with a taste they can't resist, they'll warm up to you in no time! Not intended for human consumption.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这种特制混合宠物食品是邪魔龙龙的最爱。仅含优质天然原料，为邪魔龙提供所需的均衡营养。其诱人的味道让它们无法抗拒，很快就会与你亲近！请勿供人类食用。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
